  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to the Economic Recovery of Iraq through Employment Creation and Revitalization of Local Economies II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme contributes to the improvement of economic conditions in conflict affected areas in Iraq, and the creation of sustainable employment in particular. It utilizes a multi-faceted approach to livelihoods that includes short term support such as cash for work, longer-term support for both micro-enterprises as well as small and medium enterprises, and support for the rehabilitation of community-level key economic infrastructure that is critical to support businesses and job creation.</narrative>
  </description>
